# LINE ENDINGS ARE THE INDEX'S, ON EVERY CHECKOUT. Every text file in the index is LF; with
# core.autocrlf on, a Windows checkout wrote 622 of them CRLF and left 89 LF, and six suites that read
# a tracked file and compared it with LF text failed for it on 2026-10-09 - pass or fail decided by
# which group a file happened to be in. tools/guard/lf_checkout.py checks the working copy against
# this file and puts it right (--fix).
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe reads a batch file's labels by its line ends
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
